-</section>
-<section id="page-map" class="page" aria-label="Built-in map"><div class="page-heading"><span class="eyebrow dark">FIND YOUR WAY</span><h2>Find your way.</h2><p>Interactive city map with landmarks and your GPS position when permitted.</p></div>
- <div class="map-topbar"><select id="mapCity" aria-label="Select city"><option>Shanghai</option><option>Chongqing</option><option>Chengdu</option><option>Beijing</option></select><button class="secondary-btn" id="locateBtn">Locate me</button></div>
- <label class="field"><span>Search saved places (English or 中文)</span><input id="mapSearch" type="search" placeholder="Hotel, attraction or Chinese name"></label>
- <div class="map-shell"><div id="mapCanvas"><div class="map-placeholder"><span aria-hidden="true">地图</span><b>Loading the in-app map…</b><small>The street map needs internet. Your trip details remain available offline.</small></div></div></div>
- <details class="online-map-help"><summary>Online place search</summary><button id="mapSearchOnline" class="secondary-btn full">Search online OSM — sends the search text</button><p class="caption">Offline search stays on this device. Online search sends your text and selected city to OpenStreetMap Nominatim. It may be unavailable in China.</p></details>
- <div id="mapMessage" class="notice">Landmark pins are approximate reference points, not confirmed building entrances. Route calculation and voice-guided navigation are not included yet.</div>
