-</section>
-<section id="page-translate" class="page" aria-label="Translator"><div class="page-heading"><span class="eyebrow dark">SPEAK WITH CONFIDENCE</span><h2>Words that<br>open doors.</h2><p>Start once, then speak English and Mandarin in alternating turns. Experimental on iPhone Safari.</p></div>
- <details class="voice-options"><summary>Conversation & online translation options</summary> <details class="voice-help"><summary>About voice on iPhone</summary><div class="warning">Experimental two-way conversation: one tap starts alternating English and Mandarin speech recognition, translation and playback. <strong>Not uninterrupted simultaneous interpretation.</strong> Safari may stop listening and require another tap. Unknown phrases need the optional online provider.</div></details>
- <label class="online-opt"><input type="checkbox" id="onlineTranslate"> Allow free online translation for unknown phrases (sends spoken/text phrase to a third-party service; internet required)</label>
-</details>
- <div class="translate-mode"><button id="toChineseBtn" class="seg active">English → Chinese</button><button id="toEnglishBtn" class="seg">Chinese → English</button></div>
- <label class="field-label" for="translateInput">Type or dictate a phrase</label><textarea id="translateInput" rows="3" placeholder="How much is this?"></textarea>
- <div class="button-row"><button class="primary-btn" id="translateBtn">Translate phrase</button><button class="secondary-btn" id="voiceBtn">Start two-way conversation</button></div>
- <label class="online-opt"><input id="autoSpeak" type="checkbox" checked> Speak translated text automatically (Replay is available if Safari blocks playback)</label><div class="notice" id="translationSource" lang="en">English and Chinese source text will appear here.</div><div class="translation-result" id="translateResult"><small>TRANSLATION</small><strong>Enter a phrase above</strong><span>Saved phrases also work offline.</span></div>
- <label class="field" for="speechSpeed"><span>Speech speed (English & Mandarin)</span><select id="speechSpeed"><option value="0.55">Very slow · 0.55×</option><option value="0.70" selected>Slow · 0.70× (recommended)</option><option value="0.85">Relaxed · 0.85×</option><option value="1.00">Normal · 1.00×</option></select></label><p class="caption">Controls how fast the app speaks both languages. Your choice stays saved on this device.</p>
