+ <div class="panel"><h3>Privacy & limitations</h3><p>Imported bookings are saved in <b>localStorage</b> on your device, not encrypted. Avoid shared devices. Safari clearing website data or switching browsers will remove saved data. Export or re-import a backup.</p><p>Maps need internet, and mainland China may block some third-party tiles. Saved itinerary, phrasebook, currency math and imported bookings can work offline after first successful install.</p><p>Tracker sync uses only the read-only Google Sheets permission. Google describes this scope as viewing all your spreadsheets; this app requests only the fixed tracker. Access tokens stay in memory and disappear on reload. No client secret or refresh token is used. Two-way voice mode is experimental and can stop on iPhone Safari. Full reliable always-listening translation and live metro routing are not implemented.</p></div>
